            "source_snippet": "import sys\n\ndef max_monsters_defeated(N, A, B):\n    # Initialize the dp array where dp[i] represents the maximum monsters defeated up to the i-th town\n    dp = [0] * (N + 1)\n    \n    # Base case: the first hero can defeat up to B[0] monsters in the first two towns\n    dp[1] = min(A[0], B[0])\n    dp[2] = min(A[1], B[0]) + min(A[0], B[0] - dp[1])\n    \n    # Fill the dp array for the rest of the towns\n    for i in range(3, N + 1):\n        dp[i] = max(dp[i - 1], dp[i - 2] + min(A[i - 1], B[i - 2]))\n    \n    return dp[N]\n\n# Read input from stdin\ninput = sys.stdin.read\ndata = input().split()\n\nN = int(data[0])\nA = list(map(int, data[1:N + 2]))\nB = list(map(int, data[N + 2:]))\n\n# Calculate and print the result\nresult = max_monsters_defeated(N, A, B)\nprint(result)",
