            "source_snippet": "import sys\n\ndef max_monsters_defeated(N, A, B):\n    # Initialize the DP table\n    dp = [0] * (N + 2)\n    \n    # Fill the DP table\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        dp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[i - 1])  # Option 1: Hero i does not help\n        dp[i + 1] = max(dp[i + 1], dp[i - 1] + min(B[i - 1], A[i - 1] + A[i]))  # Option 2: Hero i helps\n    \n    return dp[N + 1]\n\n# Read input\ninput = sys.stdin.read\ndata = input().split()\n\nN = int(data[0])\nA = list(map(int, data[1:N + 2]))\nB = list(map(int, data[N + 2:]))\n\n# Calculate and print the result\nresult = max_monsters_defeated(N, A, B)\nprint(result)",
